# Roster agents' project-developed skills and learning. Committed on purpose:
# what the `verifier` agent learned about testing *this* codebase is a project
# asset, not a per-clone scratch file — otherwise every checkout and every CI
# run starts the agents from zero. Runtime counters and the pre-optimization
# archive stay local.
!.wrongstack/agents/
!.wrongstack/agents/**

.wrongstack/agents/**/archive/
.wrongstack/agents/**/skills/affinity.json
.wrongstack/agents/**/learned.md
.wrongstack/agents/**/quarantine.md

